@@text Results 2026-10-27 evening run: SQ-HT-01 FAIL then PASS: both handlers threw `Cannot call property players` every
@@text interval (`level.players` is a bean property); fixed to `level.getPlayers()`, no error after. SQ-HT-02, -03 need a
@@text player (the handlers skip levels with none): client session.
