## SQ-HT-01
@group A
@commands Boot; `/reload`; grep latest.log for `armor_effects.js`, `dragon_autorepair.js`
@pass No script error; no `Error occurred while handling event` on `ServerEvents.tick`
@fails `level.players()` or `server.getAllLevels()` not visible to Rhino: use `level.getPlayers()`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
bootexpect Done \(
> reload
waitlog Added [0-9]+ recipes 120
sleep 5
kjsreject (armor_effects|dragon_autorepair)\.js.*(Error|error)
reject Error occurred while handling event.*ServerEvents\.tick|Error occurred while handling event
## SQ-HT-02
@group same
@commands Summon a tamed horse, `/item replace entity @e[type=horse,limit=1,sort=nearest] horse.armor with dragonloot:dragon_horse_armor`; wait 11 s; `/data get entity @e[type=horse,limit=1,sort=nearest] ActiveEffects`; same on the player and on a second horse without armor
@pass Regeneration (Amplifier 0) on the armored horse only; no repair (armor has no durability, branch removed 2026-10-28)
@fails Handler never fires: check `event.getServer()` on `ServerEvents.tick`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> forceload add 320 400 336 416
> pbot spawn ht 328.5 -60 412.5 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 2
> summon minecraft:horse 326 -60 404 {Tame:1b,Tags:["ht2a"],NoAI:1b}
> summon minecraft:horse 332 -60 404 {Tame:1b,Tags:["ht2b"],NoAI:1b}
> item replace entity @e[type=minecraft:horse,tag=ht2a,limit=1] horse.armor with dragonloot:dragon_horse_armor
> cdevtest tickwarp 220
waitlog verb=tickwarp end=done ticks=220 30
> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:horse,tag=ht2a,limit=1] ActiveEffects
> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:horse,tag=ht2b,limit=1] ActiveEffects
> cdevtest player ht
expect has the following entity data: (?=.*Id: 10b?\b)(?=.*Amplifier: 0b)
expect Found no elements matching ActiveEffects
reject verb=player name=ht effects=\S*minecraft:regeneration
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0
look the armoured horse (first data get) has Regeneration (Id 10) amplifier 0; the second horse and the bot have none
## SQ-HT-03
@group same
@commands Same horse; `/execute in minecraft:the_nether run tp @s 0 100 0`, `/forceload add` the horse's chunk first, wait 30 s, come back, `/data get` the horse's `ActiveEffects`
@pass No Regeneration while away (no player in the overworld); back within 10 s after return
@fails
@reviewed 2026-11-16
